1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,920
The toolbar on the left of the chart holds the drawing tools.

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:11,330
Each button opens a group of tools. Pick Trend Line.

3
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:18,690
Click where the line starts, then click where it ends.

4
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:22,990
Click a drawing to select it. The bar above lets you change its colour, width and style.

5
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,350
Press Delete to remove it.

6
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:28,280
The next button holds the Fibonacci and Gann tools.

7
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:31,700
Pick Fibonacci Retracement.

8
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:37,080
Click the start of the move, then the end.

9
00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:42,440
The retracement levels are drawn between the two points, with their prices.

10
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:46,440
Further down: shapes, measuring tools, pitchforks, text and notes, patterns and more.

